OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Schubert
OL,6,     F5/5. Kate Molleson journeys
OL,7,     Fthrough the last five years of
OL,8,     FFranz Schubert's life. Today,
OL,9,     Ffocusing on his final year, when
OL,10,     FSchubert composed some of his most
OL,11,     Ficonic chamber music.
OL,12,G1700 In Tune
OL,13,     FPierre-Laurent Aimard plays live.
OL,14,     FMusic historian Kate Williams on
OL,15,     Fpresenting upcoming episodes of
OL,16,     FRadio 3's Key Changes.
OL,17,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,18,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,20,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,21,     FMacMillan, Handel and Rachmaninov.
