OL,5,G1930 Friday Night is Music Night
OL,6,     FSaxophonist Amy Dickson joins
OL,7,     Fconductor Owain Park and the BBC
OL,8,     FConcert Orchestra at The Anvil in
OL,9,     FBasingstoke for a concert of music
OL,10,     Fconnected to the stars and
OL,11,     Fheavens.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: In Voice
OL,13,     FTenor Nicky Spence celebrates
OL,14,     Fgreat voices and the power of
OL,15,     Funforgettable singing, exploring
OL,16,     Fwhat makes a voice distinctive.
OL,17,G2200 Late Junction
OL,18,     FVerity Sharp picks adventurous
OL,19,     Fmusic inspired by agricultural
OL,20,     Fcycles and their rituals, with
OL,21,     Ftracks from Mary Stark, Sordure
OL,22,     Fand Matmos.
